abstract: >-
  Reproducible simulation software, regression tests, raw experiment records,
  source checkpoints and analysis for resource-aware decentralised quantum
  interconnects. Includes distinct abstract event-network, native photonic,
  application timing, quantum-overlay and ideal compiled-channel evidence.
  No physical hardware or journal acceptance is claimed.
keywords:
  - quantum networks
